# Expected SHA-256 hashes for archives in board/lib_extra/.
# Format: <64-hex-hash>  <filename>
# Lines starting with '#' are comments. Blank lines are skipped.
#
# Add a hash here when you vendor an archive. Verify before
# committing — see board/lib_extra/README.md for sourcing notes.
#
# Yui currently ships the override as committed C source compiled into
# the firmware via build_src_filter — see board/lib_extra/freedom_override.c
# and src/lib_extra_override/. No pre-built archives are vendored in
# this directory; if you choose to vendor one (e.g. a full patched
# libnet80211.a from a verified upstream), append its hash here using
# the format below.
#
#   <64-hex-hash>  <filename>
#
# Example (uncomment + replace if you vendor a pre-built):
#   d41d8cd98f00b204e9800998ecf8427e0000000000000000000000000000abcd  libnet80211.a
